  {
    "text": "Holding social tokens allows the individual to gain access to benefits including unreleased\rcontent, private communities, direct access to celebrity, early-access to tickets and more as well\ras the ability to trade with other communities in order to gain access to more creator content with\rearly token buyers being the biggest winners as the value of the token increases with more\rbuyers. ",
